#: ../../source/use-cases/data-journalism-mexico.md:1
msgid "Data journalism (Mexico)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-cases/data-journalism-mexico.md:3
msgid ""
"Data Crítica used ODE to identify reliable variables for journalistic "
"investigations and ensure stories are built on a solid foundation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-cases/data-journalism-mexico.md:5
msgid ""
"They used it as a central part of its “data interrogation” methodology in"
" workshops and its own research. ODE instantly flagged missing values, "
"providing a clear, visual overview of a dataset’s completeness by "
"highlighting empty cells."
msgstr ""

